{"id":"651730","name":"凉拌豇豆","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/651730/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"嫩豇豆","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"小米辣","amount":"5个"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"1个"},{"name":"姜","amount":"1块"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"嫩豇豆洗净去掉头尾。","img":"images/651730/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把豇豆切成长段。","img":"images/651730/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入盐水中煮5分钟。","img":"images/651730/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蒜和姜切成碎。","img":"images/651730/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"小米粒切成碎。","img":"images/651730/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"滴入一滴油，可以保持豇豆的嫩色。","img":"images/651730/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"豇豆煮熟以后捞出沥水。","img":"images/651730/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/651730/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"所有调料放入碗中搅拌均匀。","img":"images/651730/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"淋在豇豆上即可。","img":"images/651730/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}